Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.09,0:00:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.95,0:00:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.58,0:00:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,扎克 我无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zack. I can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.19,0:00:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前人海茫茫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It used to be we all had acquaintances.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友来来往往\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just people moving in and out of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.55,0:01:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么大不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No big.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.14,0:01:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后还会再见到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}See them down the road sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.54,0:01:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只认识几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a handful of people you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.49,0:01:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能是世界上仅存的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might as well be the only people left in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.11,0:01:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是话很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I talking too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.59,0:01:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点吧 但我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little, but I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.21,0:01:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I got you. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 已入骨 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Under my skin. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.34,0:01:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I got you. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 到心坎里 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Deep in the heart of me. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.73,0:01:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你是在让我难堪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now you're just embarrassing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.02,0:01:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 深埋心间 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ So deep in my heart. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不分离 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ That you are really a part of me. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.16,0:02:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该休息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should probably try to get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.13,0:02:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来我房里睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come crash at my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.82,0:02:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我去你那睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'll crash at your place, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一旦开始就不会停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we start doing that, we're not gonna want to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.43,0:02:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:55.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（尼克）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:14.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（D区）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:06:03.34,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.77,0:06:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.46,0:06:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.59,0:06:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,起床了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.91,0:07:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.23,0:08:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,该换岗了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Changing of the guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.83,0:08:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.50,0:08:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查完周边后我给你带早饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring you breakfast after perimeter check.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.21,0:08:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 扔掉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Throw that away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.35,0:08:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向很小心 要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always am. Any requests?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:09:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,书 漫画 变味的MM豆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Books? Comics? Some stale M&Ms?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.51,0:09:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才喜欢变味的MM豆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one that likes stale M&Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.47,0:09:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我肯定要找一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll definitely looking for some.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.53,0:09:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会找些你喜欢的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll look for some stuff you like, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不戴帽子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you wear your hat anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.27,0:09:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是农夫帽 回头见吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a farming hat. See you soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.21,0:09:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就能见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们昨天只干掉了一群\N{\fnArial\fs30}They only took out one cluster yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.34,0:09:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许今天需要更多人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably gonna need more people today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.75,0:09:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有其他计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got other plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.35,0:09:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是靠泥土和黄瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}involving dirt and cucumbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人们丰衣足食\N{\fnArial\fs30}and keeping people fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.05,0:09:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不想帮忙 我倒是想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you don't want to, maybe I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.83,0:09:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.35,0:10:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我该说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have other plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.71,0:10:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是「我们俩」有其他计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I should have said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 多吃点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.59,0:10:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad…?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.17,0:10:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.71,0:10:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 也为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. And I'm proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.25,0:10:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候能把枪还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}when can I have my gun back?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.76,0:10:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫子能给它们补充蛋白质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worms will give them some extra protein.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟紧点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 快救救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help! Please, come quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.85,0:10:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 牢房区那边吗 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cell block? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.82,0:10:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟玛姬到塔里去 别磨蹭快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the tower with Maggie. Don't argue, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.37,0:11:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- D区有行尸 - 那C区呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Walkers in D! - What about C?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全 我们已经把通往墓地的门锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear. We locked the gates to the tombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赫谢尔在值岗 - 那就不是缺口的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hershel's on guard. - It ain't a breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们按计划行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We followed the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.01,0:11:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.25,0:11:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.62,0:12:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.27,0:12:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move! - Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.64,0:12:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. Are you bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.49,0:12:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着枪 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold that. Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,被咬了吗 快出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you bit? All right, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.13,0:12:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快起来 躲到牢房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up. Get back in the cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走 待在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me. Stay in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.83,0:12:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱紧了 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.46,0:12:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦 凯伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen! Karen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:12:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得给你截肢 免得感染扩散\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to amputate your arm to stop the infection from spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.24,0:13:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,把牢房全部查一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check all of 'em… every cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上给你做手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.84,0:13:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把这个咬住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to bite this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下面安全了吧 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we clear down here? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们安全了吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're safe? - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.77,0:13:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.97,0:13:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 是帕特里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's Patrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是他们区的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始变异了 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's happening, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受到了惊吓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in shock, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.48,0:15:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你好好躺着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you just to lay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.06,0:15:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽兹和米卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie and Mica,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你关心她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}you care about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.47,0:15:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.55,0:15:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有其他亲人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have anybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们靠自己的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids on their own,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.93,0:15:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}they don't have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.31,0:15:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能照顾她们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you look out for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.71,0:16:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,视如己出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like they're yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.71,0:16:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.92,0:16:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.25,0:16:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.87,0:16:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得让她们来跟你告别\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to let them say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.03,0:16:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.05,0:16:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没被咬 没受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bites. No wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.42,0:16:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是正常死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he just died.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:17:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,死得很惨 吸入性胸膜炎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horribly, too. Pleurisy aspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.54,0:17:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,被自己的血液呛死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choked to death on his own blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以脸上全是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caused those trails down his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在栅栏外的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.94,0:17:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,脸上见到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a walker outside the fences.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也在帕特里克脸上见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw them on Patrick, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.31,0:17:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,因肺内的压力不断增加\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're from the internal lung pressure building up…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.14,0:17:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好比你摇一瓶汽水 就会把瓶盖崩开\N{\fnArial\fs30}like if you shake a soda can and pop the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.35,0:17:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only imagine your eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳朵 鼻子和喉咙好比瓶盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}ears, nose, and throat are the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.59,0:17:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是被行尸传染的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a sickness from the walkers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.66,0:17:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 它们出现之前就有这种病\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, these things happened before they were around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.83,0:17:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是肺炎球菌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be pneumococcal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.89,0:17:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能是一种急性流感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most likely an aggressive flu strain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.59,0:17:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人及时把他关了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone locked him in just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 查理经常梦游\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man. Charlie used to sleepwalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.13,0:17:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他把自己锁起来的 他昨天还吃烤肉来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked himself in. Hell, he was just eating barbecue yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.83,0:17:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会有人得了感冒一天就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could somebody die in a day just from a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.31,0:17:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有头猪病了 死得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a sick pig, it died quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.63,0:17:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在林子里见过一头病死的野猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw a sick boar in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.23,0:17:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,猪和禽类 过去疾病都是通过这些动物传染的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pigs and birds. That's how these things spread in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得处理一下那些猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to do something about those hogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.66,0:17:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能我们很幸运 只有这么两例\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we got lucky. Maybe these two cases are it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.06,0:18:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头没人幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't seen anybody be lucky in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,病菌容易近距离传播\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bugs like to run through close quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.55,0:18:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要离他再近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't get any closer than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.24,0:18:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里 已接触了病菌\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us in here, we've all been exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.93,0:18:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去找S医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go get Dr. S.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.09,0:18:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 他被咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, he's been bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.47,0:18:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生也帮不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要照顾好你妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take care of your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.56,0:18:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.91,0:18:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.69,0:19:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 时候到了 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, it's time. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.74,0:19:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道我要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.53,0:19:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是惯例\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we're always supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以在外面等\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can wait outside if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.11,0:19:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.84,0:19:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该由我们来做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be the ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽兹 你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.83,0:19:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你教过我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taught us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.54,0:19:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但是你现在就得动手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, you have to do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.43,0:19:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你立刻就得动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to do it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.39,0:19:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,得赶在他尸变前\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you have to do it before he turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.06,0:19:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna stay right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.94,0:19:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得我怎么教你们的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember what I showed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.31,0:19:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽兹 丽兹 丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie. Lizzie, Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.99,0:19:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.35,0:19:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽兹 丽兹 没事了 深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie? Lizzie, it's okay. Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.35,0:19:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着那些花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我一起数 一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count one, two, three with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.84,0:20:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一 二 - 爸爸 不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One, two… - Daddy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看 丽兹 看着这些花\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Lizzie, look at the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.83,0:20:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我数 一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count one, two, three with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.97,0:20:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着这些花 丽兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the flowers, Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.18,0:20:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 看着这些花\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Look at the flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.71,0:20:31.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（C区）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.55,0:20:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别靠近我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you might want to stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.54,0:20:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔 - 爸爸 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl. - Dad, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.02,0:20:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看见你出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see you come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.66,0:20:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 我出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.01,0:20:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 离远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. Back away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.48,0:20:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得已用了一支大门边上的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to use one of the guns by the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.43,0:20:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓我不想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear I didn't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.88,0:20:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我往回走的时候摔倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was coming back. I fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.62,0:20:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跑出来救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came out and helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.30,0:20:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.66,0:20:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.73,0:21:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕特里克昨晚生病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrick got sick last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.73,0:21:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是某种流感 发作得很急\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's some kind of flu. It moves fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.05,0:21:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为是他死了 然后攻击了牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think he died and attacked the cell block.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.30,0:21:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他是你的朋友 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know he was your friend and I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.99,0:21:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.99,0:21:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去了很多好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost a lot of good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.96,0:21:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦和你爸爸都没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn and your dad are okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.18,0:21:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们之前都在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they were in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.02,0:21:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该离任何可能被感染的人太近\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't get too close to anyone that might have been exposed,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.56,0:21:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少一段时间内不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.04,0:21:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 你们三个都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl. All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.55,0:21:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕特里克昨天还好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrick was fine yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.90,0:21:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔夜就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he died overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个人死的那么快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two people died that quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.47,0:21:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把所有接触过的人隔离\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to separate everyone that's been exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.05,0:21:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是刚进牢房区的所有人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's everyone in that cell block.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有人 也许更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all of us. Maybe more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.87,0:21:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道这种疾病可能致命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know that this sickness can be lethal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.46,0:22:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不知道它的传染性有多强\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know how easily it spreads.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.50,0:22:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他人表现出我们知道的症状吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anyone else showing symptoms that we know of?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.38,0:22:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能干等着 还有孩子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just wait and see. There's children.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.87,0:22:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是疾病的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't just the illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.20,0:22:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,人一死还会成为威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}If people die, they become a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.23,0:22:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要给他们找个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a place for them to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.52,0:22:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不能待在D区\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't stay in D.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.61,0:22:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能冒险进去清扫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't risk going in there to clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.83,0:22:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以用A区\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can use cell block A.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.59,0:22:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,死囚区吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death row?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.45,0:22:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不觉得那里更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure that's much of an upgrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.73,0:22:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里很干净 所以更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's clean. That's an upgrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.77,0:22:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,S医生应该没问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think that'll work for Dr. S?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.47,0:22:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮迦勒一起整理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll help Caleb get it set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.59,0:22:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.08,0:22:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗 听起来可不怎么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure? You don't sound so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.79,0:22:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带她去我的房间 让她休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just taking her back to my cell so she can rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.32,0:22:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰尔西 那不是好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese, I don't think that's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.94,0:22:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 这是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What's going on now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.00,0:22:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们觉得可能是流感之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think it's a flu or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.06,0:23:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕特里克就那么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how Patrick died.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.72,0:23:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱迪思在那个牢房区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judith was in that cell block.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.75,0:23:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.68,0:23:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何可能已经病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone that may be sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.35,0:23:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者可能被感染的人都应该离远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}or even exposed should stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.60,0:23:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帕特里克死于这个病吗 - 她会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It killed Patrick? - She's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.17,0:23:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们知道帕特里克的死因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that we know what Patrick died from.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.07,0:23:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就有办法解决 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can treat it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.59,0:23:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别慌 我们会搞清楚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't panic. We're going to figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.89,0:23:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但与此同时我们需要把你隔离\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we should keep you separated in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.22,0:23:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让迦勒去看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have Caleb take a look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.05,0:23:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看有没有什么药物治疗的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see what we have in the way of medications.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.24,0:23:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪凯特组的大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}David from the Decatur group,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.93,0:23:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也在咳嗽\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's been coughing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.38,0:23:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.85,0:23:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,坟墓那边还有干净的空房间吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some empty clean cells in the tombs, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.14,0:23:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 我们在那里碰头 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, we'll meet you there. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.60,0:23:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.72,0:23:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去把你安顿好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.94,0:23:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会儿还得开会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have to call another meeting later.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.95,0:23:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.34,0:23:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去埋死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get to burying the dead ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.95,0:23:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得戴手套和面罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wear gloves and a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.35,0:24:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.01,0:24:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心丽兹和米卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried about Lizzie and Mica.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.54,0:24:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在帕特里克身边待过\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were around Patrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.52,0:24:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都待过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all were.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.46,0:24:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦和大卫在情况好转前都先隔离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen and David are gonna be separated till they feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.46,0:24:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说的对 - 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're right. - Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.64,0:24:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能有事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. Got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.36,0:24:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,得把你爸爸埋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna bury your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.40,0:24:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以来看看他 给他带点花\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can visit, bring him flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.98,0:24:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽兹 我们得谈谈里头发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie, we're gonna have to talk about what happened in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.76,0:24:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸叫我对你视如己出 我会做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your daddy asked me to protect you like you're my own and I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.02,0:24:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候跟你说实话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time someone told you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.68,0:25:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你不够坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you're weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.84,0:25:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时完全吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost your nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.11,0:25:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得一直勇敢果断才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to trust your gut and you have to act fast every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.12,0:25:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这攸关生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.50,0:25:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.93,0:25:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, and I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.14,0:25:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你想活下去 就得坚强起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you want to live, you have to become strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.43,0:25:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.83,0:25:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了 他是我爸爸可他现在死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.He was special and now he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.32,0:25:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么要杀他 为什么要杀尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd they kill him? Why'd they kill Nick?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.93,0:25:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.29,0:25:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.95,0:25:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是脑子有点乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.24,0:25:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.18,0:26:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你当时在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you were in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.23,0:26:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了枪 我也没啥用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't much use without my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.75,0:26:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你贡献很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.98,0:26:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次你经受住了考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this time you've been taking off,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.98,0:26:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家有目共睹\N{\fnArial\fs30}you earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.86,0:26:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没你我们也走不到现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wouldn't be here without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.18,0:26:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是大家共同的努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.27,0:26:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是在你的领导下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.89,0:26:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要再带我们挺过这一回吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna help us figure this out?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.09,0:26:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞砸了太多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I screwed up too many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.73,0:26:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不得不替我照应 而我沉湎于悲痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those calls you got to make, I start down that road…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.04,0:26:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点害我儿子性情大变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost lost my boy… who he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.60,0:26:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有别的需要 我可以挺身而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever else this place needs, I'm here for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.90,0:26:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了 你经受住了考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, you earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.69,0:26:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 你能看出问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for what it's worth, you see mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.41,0:26:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see when the shit hits,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.71,0:26:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也能拿着铁锹守在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're standing there with a shovel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.42,0:26:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick! Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.94,0:27:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.64,0:27:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,声响太大把它们都引来了 这儿快不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The noise drew 'em out and now this part's starting to give.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.35,0:28:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.98,0:28:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开始把死人搬出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just started taking out the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.60,0:28:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道谁死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to know who yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.06,0:28:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.47,0:28:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你安全回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you came back safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.04,0:28:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,太傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.02,0:28:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.15,0:28:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我摔倒的时候 他们就该抛下我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I fell on my ass, they should have just left me out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.70,0:28:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是傻话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.56,0:28:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在乎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.40,0:28:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could have gotten hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.03,0:28:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在乎一个人时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you care about people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.92,0:28:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,受伤是在所难免的\N{\fnArial\fs30}hurt is kind of part of the package.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.25,0:28:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were there any kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.65,0:28:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,寡妇和孤儿都有称呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got all these widows and orphans,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.92,0:28:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要怎么称呼失去孩子的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what do you call someone who lost a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.44,0:28:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有人给那类人起名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd think someone would have given that a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.01,0:29:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.18,0:29:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她常那样哭吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she always cry like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.66,0:29:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她能感知人们的情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she senses people's moods.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.62,0:29:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.83,0:29:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该远离彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to stay away from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.18,0:29:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到这个了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.92,0:29:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在喂行尸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is someone feeding these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.71,0:29:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当心 - 快顶住这边的栅栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heads up. - This part of the fence, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.61,0:29:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.79,0:30:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快倒了 快倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna give! It's gonna give!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.39,0:30:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人退后 快点 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody back! Come on, back, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.56,0:30:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,栅栏继续往里凹陷的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fence keeps bending in like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.84,0:30:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸会闯进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}those walkers are coming over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.97,0:30:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔 把车开过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, get the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.46,0:30:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.57,0:30:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕特里克是不是天主教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know if Patrick was Catholic?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.28,0:30:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他是无神论者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he was a practicing atheist.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.86,0:31:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉你爸昨天图书馆的事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you tell your dad what you saw in the library yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.34,0:31:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.06,0:31:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会告诉他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.57,0:31:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须教那些孩子们如何生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to keep teaching those kids to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.94,0:31:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.84,0:31:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉他们父母了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you tell their parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.22,0:31:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.10,0:31:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会告诉他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.76,0:31:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我说了 这事过后他们也许会理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I do, maybe after this they'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.69,0:31:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们也许不会 我不想这个冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe they won't. I don't want to take that risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.28,0:31:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你们之间的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's between you and them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.58,0:31:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.65,0:31:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们之间的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.80,0:31:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你告诉你爸 他就会告诉家长\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you tell your dad, he'll tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.82,0:32:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如我所说 他们也许会理解 也许不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And like I said, maybe they'll understand, maybe they won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.25,0:32:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想对我爸撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to lie to my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.95,0:32:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没让你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking you to lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.95,0:32:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你别告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you not to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.86,0:32:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 夜卧床榻 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Lying in my bed at night. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.83,0:32:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不愿长大 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I don't wanna grow up. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.76,0:32:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 事事与愿违 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Nothin' ever seems to turn out right. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.16,0:32:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我不愿长大 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I don't wanna grow up. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.46,0:32:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 世间充满迷雾 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ How do you move in a world of fog. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.71,0:32:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一切变幻莫测 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ That's always changing things. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.71,0:32:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 宁为犬 勿为人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Makes me wish that I could be a dog. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.99,0:32:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 物是人已非 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ When I see the price that you pay. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.70,0:32:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我不愿长大 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I don't wanna grow up. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.49,0:32:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 事事与愿违 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Nothin' ever seems to go that way. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.16,0:32:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我不愿长大 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I don't want to grow up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.20,0:32:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 活在当下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Only thing to live for is today. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.74,0:32:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这摇篮曲真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some lullaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.59,0:32:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给她唱我喜欢的歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just sing her what I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.66,0:32:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比给她唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figure it's better than ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.54,0:32:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓人的歌谣要好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}or cradles falling out of trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.99,0:33:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 糟糕 你能抱会儿她吗 - 贝丝 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shoot. Can you hold her a second? - Beth. Beth!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.95,0:33:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托了 我满身都是萝卜渣 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, I'm covered in carrots. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.63,0:33:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.03,0:34:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.17,0:34:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.15,0:35:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.00,0:35:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 停\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.59,0:35:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.63,0:36:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽兹 它们是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizzie, those are walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.96,0:36:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,「尼克」是只行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick was a walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.47,0:36:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别为行尸死而难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't feel bad about that walker dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.45,0:36:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,要为你爸爸难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel bad about your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.38,0:36:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱他 但他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You loved him and he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.96,0:36:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.17,0:37:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.98,0:37:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.96,0:37:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是猪感染了他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think the pigs made them sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.05,0:37:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是我们感染了猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we made the pigs sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.33,0:38:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该离朱迪远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should stay away from Judy a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.93,0:38:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以防万一 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just in case. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.82,0:38:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也不想这样 但是 - 我们必须保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't like it, but… - We have to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.33,0:38:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.96,0:38:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老爸 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Dad. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.57,0:38:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔在教孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol's been teaching the kids…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.46,0:38:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么用武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to use weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.72,0:38:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么杀行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}How to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.98,0:38:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的父母不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their parents don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.49,0:38:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也不想让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she doesn't want you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.43,0:38:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你应该允许她这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you should let her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.75,0:38:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会说这你无法决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're gonna say it's not up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.73,0:38:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你可以决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.68,0:38:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.27,0:38:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.12,0:39:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.89,0:39:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.99,0:39:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.98,0:39:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl?
